*E
         A1        ARRC
         A2        D'4032
         R         XCK
*X
*
* The routines CALL3 and CALL8 call, 33 words apart, so that no two are in
* the same block of 32.
*
XF1      A6        A6+1
         J         B00
         BSS       D'32
XF2      A6        A6+1
         J         B00
         BSS       D'32
XF3      A6        A6+1
         J         B00
         BSS       D'32
XF4      A6        A6+1
         J         B00
         BSS       D'32
XF5      A6        A6+1
         J         B00
         BSS       D'32
XF6      A6        A6+1
         J         B00
         BSS       D'32
XF7      A6        A6+1
         J         B00
         BSS       D'32
XF8      A6        A6+1
         J         B00
         BSS       D'32
*
* XCK: the (A2) words from (A1) added up into S1, the sum turned by one bit
* before each word, so that it matters where a word stands.
*
XCK      S1        0
         A3        1
XCK1     S2        0,A1
         S1        S1,S1<A3
         S1        S1+S2
         A1        A1+1
         A2        A2-1
         A0        A2
         JAN       XCK1
         J         B00
*
* XRED: the 64 elements of V2 added up into S1 the same way.
*
XRED     S1        0
         A1        0
         A2        D'64
         A3        1
XRD1     S2        V2,A1
         S1        S1,S1<A3
         S1        S1+S2
         A1        A1+1
         A0        A2-A1
         JAN       XRD1
         J         B00
*D
XSEED    CON       O'0123456701234567012345
XGAP     CON       D'57
         CON       D'23
         CON       D'10
         CON       4
         CON       1
         CON       0
ARRA     BSS       N
ARRB     BSS       N
ARRC     BSS       N
IDXI     BSS       N
IDXJ     BSS       N
WORK     BSS       N
